        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86686, Industrial Chic Jasper Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Jasper Cabinet Pull is part of the Industrial Modern Design Trend. This Chic Jasper Pull is available in all the hottest finish choices including black and satin brass. This Industrial Chic Jasper Pull is available in a wide selection of sizes ranging from 3.5 inches all the way up to 12 inches. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/jasper-cabinet-knob-emtek-86699\"><b>Emtek Jasper Cabinet Knob</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/jasper-appliance-pull-emtek-ap-86693\"><b>Emtek Jasper Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Emtek Jasper Cabinet Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86686-specifications.pdf?v=1704262415\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek Jasper Cabinet Pull Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 7 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>86686:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86687:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86688:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86689:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>86690:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86691:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 10-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86692:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
